WEBVTT

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:05.061
Your whole H2F program.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.600
In your pocket and on the go.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.950
Add H2F Trainer to your Home Screen.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.760
Then start every day on Today.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.160
Plan it. Train it.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.012
Select your workout format.

00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:15.895
Working reps and sets.

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:17.707
Choose your stations.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.900
Or build a circuit routine.

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:23.364
300 plus exercises.

00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:26.998
Too hard? Make it easier.

00:00:27.532 --> 00:00:29.172
Too easy? Make it harder.

00:00:30.159 --> 00:00:31.629
Add your own, and share it.

00:00:37.545 --> 00:00:39.015
Hurt? Tap where it hurts.

00:00:39.796 --> 00:00:41.528
Set your injury, pain, and phase.

00:00:41.548 --> 00:00:42.668
Calm it down.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:43.850
Rebuild.

00:00:44.152 --> 00:00:45.532
Return to training.

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:48.444
Get a Monday to Friday recovery week.

00:00:49.358 --> 00:00:51.658
Pain too high? See a provider first.

00:00:52.612 --> 00:00:55.272
Sleep. Plan your bedtime around your wake-up.

00:00:55.866 --> 00:00:57.756
Fuel. Eat for the day's training.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.310
Mind. A two-minute daily check-in.

00:01:02.374 --> 00:01:04.314
Spirit. Live by your values.

00:01:06.929 --> 00:01:09.329
Leaders: see your squad. Send the plan.

00:01:11.034 --> 00:01:12.491
Earn ribbons for real work.

00:01:12.511 --> 00:01:14.101
Every area has its own.

00:01:14.789 --> 00:01:17.629
Earn them again for bronze, silver, and gold stars.

00:01:18.643 --> 00:01:19.923
H2F Trainer.

00:01:19.943 --> 00:01:22.053
Plan it. Train it. Recover. Repeat.

00:01:23.099 --> 00:01:24.157
Share it with your squad.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:26.177
Go to Unit, and tap Share the app.

00:01:26.428 --> 00:01:28.638
Send the link, or let them scan the code.
